.* FUNCTION = DADSM RENAME MACRO WHICH PROVIDES ADDRESSABILITY          00850002
.*            TO THE 720 DECIMAL BYTE WORK AREA (NOT INCLUDING @ZA31909 00900032
.*            THE 8 WORD PREFIX OR THE 6 WORD RECOVERY ROUTINE @ZA31909 00930032
.*            PARAMETER LIST) USED BY RENAME.                  @ZA31909 00960032
.*                                                                      01050002
.* NOTES = THIS MACRO IS AN INTERNAL MACRO USED IN THE FOLLOWING        01100002
.*         DADSM FUNCTIONS:                                             01150002
.*                                                                      01200002
.*             RENAME                                                   01250002
.*             SCRATCH AND RENAME VOLUME MOUNTING ROUTINE               01300002
.*                                                                      01350002
.*         TO REFERENCE THIS WORK AREA WITHIN THE FUNCTIONS LISTED      01400002
.*         ABOVE, CODE A USING STATEMENT ON THE LABEL 'RENAMWKA'.       01450002
.*                                                                      01500002
.*      DEPENDENCIES = THIS MACRO IS DESIGNED TO BE USED OPTIONALLY     01550002
.*                     WITH THE IECSDSL1 DSCB MAPPING MACRO, THE        01600002
.*                     PREFX MACRO (DEFINED IN THE IECDSECS MACRO)      01650002
.*                     WHICH DEFINES THE 8 WORD WORK AREA PREFIX,       01700002
.*                     THE 20 WORD EXTENDED WORK AREA PREFIX, AND       01750002
.*                     THE 4 WORD DADSM WTG TABLE, AND THE DSMADT       01800002
.*                     MACRO (ALSO DEFINED IN THE IECDSECS MACRO)       01850002
.*                     WHICH DEFINES THE 6 WORD DADSM AUDIT TRAIL.      01900002
.*                     THE AUDIT TRAIL MUST APPEAR AS THE      @ZA31909 01906032
.*                     FINAL 6 WORDS OF THE RENAME WORK AREA.  @ZA31909 01912032
.*                                                                      01920032
.*                     THE FIRST 364 BYTES OF THE SCRATCH AND RENAME    01950002
.*                     WORK AREAS (ADDRESSED RESPECTIVELY BY MAPPING    02000002
.*                     MACROS IECSCRWA AND IECRENWA) ARE MAPPED         02050002
.*                     IDENTICALLY - 8 WORD PREFIX, 20 WORD EXTENDED    02100002
.*                     PREFIX, 4 WORD DADSM WTG TABLE, 96 BYTE DSCB     02150002
.*                     AREA, AND 140 BYTE DSCB AREA.  THE 250  @ZA31909 02200032
.*                     BYTES FROM LABELS 'WKADEB' THROUGH      @ZA31909 02230032
.*                     'PVOLSER' ARE ALSO MAPPED IDENTICALLY.  @ZA31909 02260032
.*                                                                      02350002
.*      RESTRICTIONS = NONE                                             02400002
.*                                                                      02450002
.*      REGISTER CONVENTIONS = NOT APPLICABLE                           02500002
.*                                                                      02550002
.* PATCH LABEL = NOT APPLICABLE                                         02600002
.*                                                                      02650002
.* MODULE TYPE = MACRO                                                  02700002
