.*                                                                      03550002
.*      INPUT =                                                         03600002
.*                                                                      03650002
.*                OPTIONAL LABEL SPECIFIED AS AN ACCEPTABLE ASSEMBLER   03700002
.*                LABEL WHICH CAN BE USED BY THE CALLING CSECT TO       03750002
.*                ESTABLISH ADDRESSABILITY TO THE ENTIRE WORK AREA.     03800002
.*                                                                      03850002
.*                EP IS THE FIRST POSITIONAL PARAMETER, SPECIFYING      03900002
.*                THAT THE LABELS FOR EACH OF THE FIELDS IN THE 8       03950002
.*                WORD PREFIX, THE 20 WORD EXTENDED PREFIX, AND THE 4   04000002
.*                WORD DADSM WTG TABLE ARE TO BE EXPANDED.  IF THESE    04050002
.*                FIELDS ARE NOT TO BE DEFINED, A COMMA MUST BE CODED   04100002
.*                TO INDICATE THE ABSENCE OF THIS PARAMETER.            04150002
.*                                                                      04200002
.*                F4 IS THE SECOND POSITIONAL PARAMETER, SPECIFYING     04250002
.*                THAT THE FIELDS OF THE FORMAT 4 DSCB ARE TO BE        04300002
.*                EXPANDED USING THE IECSDSL1 DSCB MAPPING MACRO.       04350002
.*                IF THESE FIELDS ARE NOT TO BE DEFINED AND A           04400002
.*                KEYWORD PARAMETER FOLLOWS, A COMMA MUST BE            04450002
.*                CODED TO INDICATE THE ABSENCE OF THIS PARAMETER.      04500002
.*                                                                      04550002
.*                D1=(N) IS A KEYWORD PARAMETER THAT SPECIFIES THE      04600002
.*                FORMAT(S) OF THE DSCB(S) TO BE EXPANDED IN THE        04650002
.*                140 BYTE DSCB AREA, USING THE IECSDSL1 MACRO.         04700002
.*                N CAN BE A NUMBER FROM 0 - 6.  IF N IS 0 OR 4 OR      04750002
.*                IF THIS KEYWORD IS OMITTED, NO LABELS ARE EXPANDED.   04800002
.*                IF N IS 1, 2, 3, 5, OR 6, THE CORRESPONDING FORMAT    04850002
.*                OF THE DSCB WILL BE EXPANDED.  MORE THAN ONE DSCB     04900002
.*                FORMAT CAN BE MAPPED IN THE 140 BYTE DSCB AREA        04950002
.*                BY SEPARATING THE FORMAT NUMBERS BY COMMAS.           05000002
.*                                                                      05050002
.*                ADT=YES IS A KEYWORD PARAMETER WHICH SPECIFIES THAT   05100002
.*                THE LABELS FOR EACH OF THE FIELDS WITHIN THE 6 WORD   05150002
.*                DADSM AUDIT TRAIL ARE TO BE EXPANDED.                 05200002
.*                                                                      05250002
